CM_ SG_ 566 SteeringAngleRaw "Matches the 0x238 sign/magnitude copy. Physical degrees/count and left/right sign remain unverified.";
CM_ SG_ 566 SteeringAngularVelocityRaw "Tracks the smoothed derivative of SteeringAngleRaw; physical scale remains unverified.";
CM_ SG_ 568 SteeringAngleNegative "Apply sign to SteeringAngleMagnitudeRaw: 1 means negative.";
CM_ SG_ 824 TransmissionOutputSpeedRaw "0xFFF means unavailable. Identity is confirmed; physical rpm scale remains provisional.";
CM_ SG_ 824 TransmissionTurbineSpeed "0xFFF means unavailable. Big-endian 12-bit value tracks engine rpm and converter slip at 1 rpm/count.";
CM_ SG_ 768 YawRateRaw "Centered at raw word 0x8000. 0x4000 and 0xFFFF occur as invalid/state sentinels. Physical scale and sign direction remain unverified.";
CM_ SG_ 808 LateralAccelerationRaw "Centered at raw byte 0x80. 0x00 and 0xFF occur as invalid/state sentinels. Physical scale and sign direction remain unverified.";
CM_ SG_ 528 AcceleratorPedalRaw "Driver accelerator-pedal value. Zero at released pedal and rises with pedal application; physical percent scale remains unverified.";
CM_ SG_ 1544 EngineCoolantTemperature "Exact gateway copy of CAN-B 0x002 byte 4. A cold-start capture rose from ambient temperature to normal operating temperature; raw encoding is degrees C plus 40.";

